  "units": [
    {
      "end_seconds": 2.7880000000000003,
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 0.008,
      "text": "There are literally 5,000 sensors on these cars."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 7.083,
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 2.868,
      "text": "For many years they've just had a few of these kind of wizards that could query this information."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 11.66,
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "I would have to go talk to one of these wizards, and eventually I'd get in the queue."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 13.682,
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 11.782,
      "text": "The model by itself is insufficient,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 18.342,
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 13.702,
      "text": "because again, you've got 5,000 sensors, and each one of these sensors"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 21.582,
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 18.582,
      "text": "has a different value, different thresholds, a different meaning."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 29.006,
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 21.641,
      "text": "so they spent like six months going all around BMW and gathering a data dictionary."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 30.405,
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 29.026,
      "text": "And this is the work that's still required."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 34.735,
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 30.425,
      "text": "I mean, if you want your AI to work with your structured data"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 38.511,
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 34.755,
      "text": "or your unstructured data or whatever, it's it seems magical, but it's not."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 41.083,
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 38.531,
      "text": "You still have to tell it what this stuff is."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 43.837,
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 41.125,
      "text": "But I was able to actually the query I made, I remember it."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 50.082,
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 43.857,
      "text": "I said, show me all the hard braking events in wet weather in the last week."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 50.977,
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 50.222,
      "text": "And it did it."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 55.547,
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 50.997,
      "text": "So rather than waiting in line for somebody to make them a query, anybody can go into"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 61.446,
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 55.567,
      "text": "the system that I'm referring to and they can use it just like I did and in a natural way."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 63.287,
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 61.466,
      "text": "So again, it wasn't magical."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 64.272,
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
